[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Version=1.0
Name=ETC NetGuard
Name[zh_CN]=ETC NetGuard
GenericName=Network Control
GenericName[zh_CN]=网络控制
Comment=Local website blocker and process network control for Linux
Comment[zh_CN]=Linux 本地网站拦截与进程网络管理
